# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Veldris (Pokemon: Piss Off Troglodyte)  -  this repo is PUBLIC.
# NEVER commit a ROM, a save file, or build output. Later lines win, so this
# block sits at the end and leaves the upstream lines above untouched.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ROMs (any name, any folder) and backups of them
*.gba
*.gba.*
# The only .gba files allowed are the three multiboot helpers upstream already
# tracks. Anything else dropped in data/ stays ignored.
data/*.gba
!data/mb_berry_fix.gba
!data/mb_colosseum.gba
!data/mb_ereader.gba
# Save files and emulator save states
*.sav
*.srm
*.sgm
*.ss[0-9]
*.state
*.st[0-9]
# Build output
build/
*.elf
*.map
*.sym
*.o

# Emulator test harness cache (generated next to the ELF, design/tools/emu/README.md)
*.emu-layout.json

# ROM-derived archives and patches (the commit hook blocks them by name too, CLAUDE.md rule 1)
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.ips
*.bps
*.ups
*.xdelta
*.ppf
